shipped-threshold value. Best cell is 35.4978 at rho_lo=0.04, rho_hi=0.25.

READ THIS AS: a small spread means the results are insensitive to the thresholds,
which is what Reviewer 2 says would be a strong point in the method's favour.
It also settles the title question and the provenance concern in major point 5.

