==============================================================================
 B8  deconvolution baseline with a data-driven bandwidth
==============================================================================
The shipped deconv baseline uses a fixed Silverman Gaussian cutoff. Reviewer 2
point 10 says that understates it. Two alternatives are run here. The first is
least-squares cross-validation, which is data driven and reportable. The second is
an ORACLE bandwidth chosen by minimising the true ISE, which no practitioner could
use and which therefore bounds how much the baseline could possibly improve.

